# Subagent Delegation

- Delegate bounded implementation to **`implementer`** at **`composer-2.5-fast`**.
- Delegate exploration or gap mapping to **`explore`** or **`generalPurpose`** at **`composer-2.5-fast`**.
- Use the applicable review skill for code or security review.
- Implement trivial work directly when delegation would add more overhead than value.
- The parent integrates and verifies subagent output before treating work as done.
- Stop and report scope or architecture conflicts instead of silently expanding the task.
